        }
      }
    },
    "TREATMENT": {
      "present": true,
      "status": "content",
      "content_blocks": [
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "No curative therapy—a number of surgical",
          "pdf_page": 935,
          "printed_page": 853,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "and medical treatments may be tried.",
          "pdf_page": 935,
          "printed_page": 853,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Rest and massage of the affected limbs do not help.",
          "pdf_page": 935,
          "printed_page": 853,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Conservative care—long-term use of pressure wraps, coupled with skin care and use of antibiotics to treat cellulitis and lymphangitis; may be successful in some patients.",
          "pdf_page": 935,
          "printed_page": 853,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Surgical procedures—attempted when conservative care and medications fail; two main categories: (1) Facilitate lymph drainage (lymphangioplasty, bridging techniques, lymphaticovenous shunts, superficial and deep lymphatic anastomosis). (2) Excisional procedures to remove abnormal tissue; no treatment consistently beneficial; excisional",
          "pdf_page": 935,
          "printed_page": 853,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "procedures reported in dogs only.",
          "pdf_page": 935,
          "printed_page": 853,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "In humans—microwave heating of affected areas appears beneficial and adds to the effect of",
          "pdf_page": 935,
          "printed_page": 853,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "benzopyrones (see Drugs of Choice).",
          "pdf_page": 935,
          "printed_page": 853,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Diets severely restricted in long-chain triglycerides are being investigated in humans.",
          "pdf_page": 935,
          "printed_page": 853,
          "column": 2
        }
      ],
